# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) or pass as a Docker build arg. Vite only exposes
# VITE_-prefixed variables to the client, and it does so by INLINING them into the
# bundle at build time — so changing one means rebuilding, not restarting.

# Origin of the ICAROS flight controller's WebSocket host, read by src/main.ts.
# A bare host gets :5183 by default (see scripts/start.ts). Must be https:// —
# the page itself is served over TLS, and browsers block ws:// from a secure page.
# Unset -> https://localhost:5183. Overridable per-visit with ?host=… in the URL,
# which is what the headset uses, so hosting without this set is fine.
VITE_ICAROS_HOST=https://192.168.1.50:5183
